n is finally complete. You know "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["this for certain because you can now see the "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["'hot spring' for what it truly is."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset14", 3, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wow, this place must be magic or "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["something. My old body should have burnt "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to a crisp just looking at this place."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["MGFaceset14", 3, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Maybe it's just the 'new me' talking but "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["this place ain't half bad. I think I "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["might stay here permanently..."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 2, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Salamander1", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You never do leave the lava pool you now call home."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ocasionally you might exit the depths to sit along "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the rim for an hour or two but from then on you "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["never again leave the confines of that cave."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 2, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Salamander4", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You survive purely on the gifts the lizardwomen "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["bring you, apparently they revere you as some "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters":